rs, bike storage, visitor parking, secure access and landscaped outdoor spaces.  This bright 761 sq. ft. fifth-floor condo features 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, an open-concept layout, large windows, mountain and greenery views, quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, laminate flooring, in-suite laundry, A/C and a private glass balcony. The primary bedroom includes an ensuite and built-in storage. (id:67604)"},"30333627":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/reb89/highres/9/R3169939_17.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639261466861800000/