 and more. 1 bed and a power room on ground floor, 2 bed and 2 full bath on the 3rd floor. (id:67604)"},"30389931":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639272268037170000/reb89/highres/2/R3174372_12.jpg"],"remarks":"Burquitlam Capital, a hidden gem within a rapidly growing community! This recently renovated 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom corner unit boasts a functional layout, featuring newly replaced laminate flooring throughout all rooms. Its contemporary design includes an open kitchen with quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, and built-in microwave and oven. Conveniently located just steps away from Burquitlam Skytrain station and Burquitlam Plaza, and a mere 5-minute drive to Lougheed Mall. 1 parking space & 1 locker. Public EV Charging available. (id:67604)"},"30408267":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639276838883230000/reb89/highres/8/R3175848_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639276838883230000/reb89/highres/8/R3175848_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639276