ts and access to the balcony. The gourmet kitchen features all stainless steel appliances and lots of cabinet space. Upstairs features the bedrooms with soft carpets. The primary bedroom comes with 3 closets and a 4 pcs ensuite bathroom. Down the hall is the decently sized 2nd bedroom and a 3pc bathroom. 1 parking in garage and 1 in the driveway. Short walk to Hillcrest Village, Clayton Crossing for shopping and restaurants and the future Clayton Skytrain Station. (id:67604)"},"30469035":{"photos":["https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_1.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_2.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_3.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_4.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_5.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_6.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_7.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_8.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_9.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_10.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_11.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_12.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_13.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_14.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_15.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_16.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639292238494800000/reb89/highres/7/R3180127_